# Response headers for the Cloudflare deployment.
#
# These are the same directives the site carried in netlify.toml, moved to the
# `_headers` convention the static-assets layer reads. netlify.toml was
# Netlify-only and Cloudflare ignored it, so this file was always the one
# served - which is why the twin is gone now that every directive it carried
# lives here. This is the only copy: what is written here is the whole policy.
#
# Single-file app: inline scripts/styles are intrinsic, so lock down
# everything else (objects, frames, base-uri, form-action). Data files
# ship with the site itself, so connect-src is self-only.
#
# script-src pins the page's two inline scripts by SHA-256 rather than allowing
# 'unsafe-inline'. It used to allow it, which made this the one site where an
# injected script would simply run: nothing injects into the page today (every
# value that reaches HTML goes through escapeHtml, and the row HTML is built
# from the scraper's whitelisted decisions file), and the two hashes are what
# hold that line once it stops being true - a script arriving from anywhere else
# is refused by the browser instead of executed.
#
# The hashes are checked rather than trusted: `python tools/check_csp_hashes.py`
# recomputes them from index.html, fails on a missing or an orphaned hash, and
# fails if 'unsafe-inline' returns to script-src. It runs in CI beside the
# scraper tests, and after an edit to an inline script it prints the exact hash
# to paste below.
#
# Those hashes carry a subtlety the checker documents at length: the browser
# hashes the script's SOURCE TEXT, and HTML's input-stream preprocessing turns
# CRLF into LF before the parser sees it. This file is CRLF, so hashing its raw
# bytes computes a value every browser rejects — which is exactly what happened
# on the first attempt here, and what the checker now avoids.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' 'sha256-wIvDxHO2wIrh28fbnwUaWD+6iHtzKsmjEowgZ5ev4l4=' 'sha256-ZQLONdJXbVls9sFoPaYpcaj5wcoOMkGE83Hl1g/TvAs='; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self' data:; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
